      "title": "Unauthorized Activity",
      "visualSettings": "{\"text\":{\"alignment\":\"left\",\"format\":\"markdown\"},\"title\":{\"fontSize\":24}}",
      "keepVisualSettingsConsistentWithParent": true,
      "panelType": "TextPanel",
      "text": "##Track suspicious and unauthorized runtime activity:\n\n1. Runtime Events shows all runtime events over time.\n\n2. Unauthorized Images Activity shows the number of attempts to start unauthorized images\n\n3. Unauthorized File Activity shows the number of attempts to run or touch unauthorized files\n\n4. Unauthorized Network Activity shows the number networks events that violate the microservices' firewall rules\n\n\n\nClick the tile for additional information"
    },
